---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import TermsHero from "../../components/Terms/TermsHero.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms and Conditions for Mahakali Home Furnitures & Interiors."
  path="/terms"
>
  <main class="terms-page">
    <TermsHero 
      title="Terms Of Service" 
      subtitle="Please read these terms and conditions carefully before using our website or purchasing our products."
    />
    
    <section class="policy-section wrap section">
      <div class="policy-container">
        <h2 class="font-display">TERMS & CONDITIONS</h2>
        
        <ol class="terms-list">
          <li>By accessing, browsing, or purchasing from this website, you agree to comply with all terms, policies, and conditions listed here.</li>
          <li>All products listed are subject to availability. In case a product is unavailable after placing the order, the customer will be informed and can choose refund or replacement.</li>
          <li>Product dimensions, textures, fabric patterns, and wood grains may vary slightly due to natural and manufacturing conditions.</li>
          <li>Prices displayed on the website are inclusive of basic taxes unless otherwise mentioned. Delivery and installation charges may apply depending on location and product type.</li>
          <li>Any unauthorized use of website content, including images, text, product descriptions, or branding, is prohibited.</li>
          <li>Custom orders (made based on selected fabric, polish finish, size, or design changes) cannot be canceled once confirmed.</li>
          <li>Mahakali holds the right to cancel orders caused by errors in pricing, stock updates, or misuse of discount codes.</li>
          <li>Delivery timelines mentioned are estimates. Actual delivery may vary due to logistics issues, weather conditions, transportation delays, or unforeseen circumstances.</li>
          <li>Any visible damage to the product or packaging must be reported at the time of delivery with photos/video. Complaints raised after the delivery personnel leave may not be accepted.</li>
          <li>If the customer refuses delivery without valid reason, any delivery charges, return charges, or re-delivery charges must be borne by the customer.</li>
          <li>Assembly/installation services (where applicable) must be scheduled as per availability of service partners. Delays due to service partner schedules do not qualify for refunds.</li>
          <li>Offers, coupons, or discounts cannot be combined unless specifically mentioned by the company.</li>
          <li>Mahakali reserves the right to modify, update, or remove any part of these Terms & Conditions without prior notice.</li>
          <li>By placing an order, the customer acknowledges having read, understood, and agreed to all policies including Terms & Conditions, Privacy Policy, Cancellation Policy, and Refund Policy.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .policy-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 8rem;
  }
  .policy-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .policy-container {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
  
  .policy-container h2 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-line);
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  
  .policy-container ol.terms-list {
    list-style-type: decimal;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  
  .policy-container li {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
</style>
